&lt;li&gt;Become an expert in infrastructure performance, helping us optimize from the application level all the way through the firmware&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build for resilience. Our goal is that nobody’s pager goes off, ever. Are we there yet? No. Are we really close? Very. While we work on that - participate in a weekly on-call rotation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve our infrastructure capabilities, optimizing for cost, simplicity, and maintainability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
